# Illustration examples

These examples use invented households. They are drawings, not screenshots, and they do not operate devices. For a diagram on a dashboard and in a guidance page, see [Illustration accessibility](illustration-accessibility.html).

## In the Companion app

On a phone, an illustration must stay readable at a small size and sit above its text, not beside it.

These 2 screens show a heating routine and where to put a sensor. Times and steps are in the text, not in the drawing.

